  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: '[Real Path] Draws a line tracing the path of the Zeta function as
    the sigma component changes. It provides a visual representation of how the function
    evolves along the sigma axis.  Euler-Maclaurin summation is used to calculate
    the sigma path.'
